,{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いでしょ？？(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまに派手になりたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気分の時は被ります♪(´ε｀ )へへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんいつもこんなのばかりじゃないよ？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"清楚なのもたくさん着ます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/27/9919122/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな系統を着こなせるようになりたいの(#^.^#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！！！そうそう、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊急発表されたとうり、あみたちは7月30日から、東京タワーにて、公開ラジオ収録をやる事が決定しました(=´∀｀)人(´∀｀=)よしゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな！ほれみんな！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来るしかないでしょ！？！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみがやる日程とか、誰とやるかとか、詳しい事は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46公式ホームページにて掲載されるのでね、みんなちゃんと見て絶対に来てよ？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドキドキワクワクだあね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの皆様と近距離で生収録するわけだから（＾＿＾）☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドキドキワクワクといえば！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は名古屋であみたち踊るよー？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"永島せいらの故郷でo(^▽^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして明後日の長崎もあみたち出るから"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/27/9919122/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！長崎は川後ひなの故郷よね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみたちたっくさん踊って歌うから、来れる方すっごく楽しみにしててね＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんじゃ！質問返しといきましょ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. 資格とか免許持ってる？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.乃木坂46という資格があります！！！どや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ .「あみプレミアムアウトレット（茨城県）」に行ったことはある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.んーないよー茨城県はまだ行ったことないの ╭(๑¯⌓¯๑)╮"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. ポイントカードでポイントを貯めていますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.うん！銀だこと、タピオカ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ .メンバーと喧嘩したことはありますか?あったらアンサーお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.メンバーと喧嘩した事ないんだ（＾∇＾）そんなイライラしないタイプ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.握手会で生年月日が一緒って言ったらわかる⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.もちろん！！だからあみの握手会絶対に来て？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ .清水翔太さんの曲で特におすすめの曲は何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.「君が好き」とか、「桜」とか！聞いてみて？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ .あみあみは普段寝る時どんなスタイルですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.すっごくラフだよー？夏はＴシャツに短パンジャージとか。うん可愛いネグリジェが欲しいね。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、冬になるとブタの着ぐるみとかきて寝るよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.カラオケの18番は⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.松田聖子さんの天使のウインク(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.スケートリンクみたいな私\"って？どういうイミ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.以前かずみんに、あみのおでこ見せた時に、「ふっひゃっひゃっひゃ、あみのおでこってさぁー、スケートリンクみたいにツルッツルで広いよねぇーっひゃっひゃ」って言われたの。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つまりおでこがスケートリンクってこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. あみあみはポケモンやったことある？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何のポケモンが好き(｡･ω･｡)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ちょっとだけならやった事あるよ！？んっと、ポッちゃま！！とか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ. まりっかは面倒だけど、あみあみは面倒なの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.あみはねぇ、ちょっぴり面倒なときもあるかもよ？構ってちゃんだからにd(￣ ￣)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！ここまでだぜぇ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それじゃ、あみは明日の為にも寝る準備にさしかかろうと思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな大好きよん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/27/9919122/0005.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}